ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\">총장 상장과 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\">시상금 200,000원/1점 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\">혹은 상품권 대체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\">최종 선정된 작품은 홈페이지 등재 및 입시홍보 자료로 활용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial\">일 정</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pag